OL,3,AThousands of security personnel
OL,4,Adeployed as Delhi braces for
OL,5,A'cockroach' protest
OL,6,
OL,7,FParts of the Indian capital, Delhi,
OL,8,Fhave been turned into a fortress, with
OL,9,Ftens of thousands of security forces
OL,10,Fdeployed, as the influential Gen Z-led
OL,11,F"cockroach" movement has called for a
OL,12,Fmajor protest on Saturday.
OL,14,FThe protesters are seeking electoral
OL,15,Freforms and the resignation of Chief
OL,16,FElection Commissioner (CEC) Gyanesh
OL,17,FKumar over allegations of manipulating
OL,18,Fvoters' lists.
OL,20,FThe Election Commission has denied this
OL,21,Fand Kumar is yet to comment on the
OL,22,Fresignation demand.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,315,300,200,140,0,100
